{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/098dfca2ed3de7a2698317ac0c659e91.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Bethesda Game Studios, the award-winning creators of Starfield and The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim, comes Fallout 4. A landmark in open-world RPG design and winner of over 200 \u2018Best Of\u2019 honors, including the DICE and BAFTA Game of the Year. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the sole survivor of Vault 111, emerging into a world reduced to ash by nuclear war. Every moment is a battle for survival, every decision shapes the future. Rebuild, reshape, and reclaim the Wasteland\u2014your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/5f0ee5a868640265a74b503bcf08747b.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/da7e75ff538d2af951852831c81a4dd3.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/da7e75ff538d2af951852831c81a4dd3.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/da7e75ff538d2af951852831c81a4dd3.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do whatever you want in a massive open world filled with hundreds of locations, characters, and quests. Join factions, forge alliances or go it alone. The choices are yours, and every one of them matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/f61e77ce3d9724671436050fb8e69e2b.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/afa303d396ab5b07cf4b570e01c6497d.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/afa303d396ab5b07cf4b570e01c6497d.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/afa303d396ab5b07cf4b570e01c6497d.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique character with the S.P.E.C.I.A.L. system. Choose from hundreds of Perks and develop your own playstyle, whether you\u2019re a smooth-talking diplomat, stealthy sniper, or walking tank in Power Armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/96e45f901f5d8d34ec385b4d33423b6f.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/1db2fbb80734e901c3fdf6b3fe1d4d0a.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/1db2fbb80734e901c3fdf6b3fe1d4d0a.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/1db2fbb80734e901c3fdf6b3fe1d4d0a.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An all-new next generation graphics and lighting engine brings to life the world of Fallout like never before. From the blasted forests of the Commonwealth to the ruins of Boston, every location is packed with dynamic detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/47c4858932f9691b9d6cca3c7d0efc68.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/526fe07fd8291fa35d6023408543307c.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/526fe07fd8291fa35d6023408543307c.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/526fe07fd8291fa35d6023408543307c.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the dynamic Vault-Tec Assisted Targeting System (V.A.T.S.) to slow down time in combat and target enemies with cinematic precision\u2014or take the fight into your own hands with real-time gunplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/da771dcb647188df70c032e9932dfc3d.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/c4b79e9975ef388466a328d1c76d619f.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/c4b79e9975ef388466a328d1c76d619f.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/c4b79e9975ef388466a328d1c76d619f.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, craft, and customize like never before. Build thousands of items\u2014armor, weapons, food, and more\u2014and even construct and manage entire settlements across the Commonwealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/faecf43e9696b14c9b9876eec080c515.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=194 /></span><strong> </strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"War Never Changes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/377160/f3c20b49a62106c11549b08c689e1fc3953ef503.jpg"},{"name":"When Freedom Calls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/377160/cd9d36cd0bd1b6b0a5be50efff0344e2e743d65d.jpg"},{"name":"Unlikely Valentine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/377160/eda24ab938b2f7be41b445baaac6951fd6fc0faf.jpg"},{"name":"Reunions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/377160/926c0a02ca0124838e901c55e3f4bb731c67f2cb.jpg"},{"name":"Dangerous Minds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/377160/f9cbca05b4b82d3b4cb50f9eefdb3727b501e2ec.jpg"},{"name":"Hunter/Hunted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/377160/bc95eaae48bdd4968e7051344ddb76f9803411b7.jpg"},{"name":"The Molecular Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/377160/b3003cd9886336596cb7362cb2c97cd6f01091d7.jpg"},{"name":"The Nuclear Option","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/377160/41f75b4bfa21104b5dfece18ff49e24588959677.jpg"},{"name":"Institutionalized","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/377160/96c5f78eb81c684ab1c679d885ee7a9812c8d8c2.jpg"},{"name":"Mankind-Redefined","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/377160/f4d2c90a4dcdf971a0353ada44c6750b49936f0a.jpg"}],"total":84},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/377160?t=1764687456","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/377160?t=1764687456","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764687456","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764687456","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on Phone","id":41},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and Gore\r\nUse of Drugs\r\nStrong Language\r\nIntense Violence\r\nIn-Game Purchases"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Choose Your Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/c368cc46324508164af5d8df217470d7.avif?t=1764687456\" width=940 height=528 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Fallout 4: Anniversary Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/a78730aa233d024d814a63943080fce3.avif?t=1764687456\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras_big/a78730aa233d024d814a63943080fce3.webp?t=1764687456 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For ten years, Fallout 4 has stood as one of the most celebrated open-world RPGs of all time. Now, the Fallout 4: Anniversary Edition brings the complete post-nuclear epic together in one definitive package. Winner of over 200 \u201cBest Of\u201d awards including the DICE and BAFTA Game of the Year, this edition includes the acclaimed base game, the 6 official expansions, and more than 150 Creation Club items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes the full base game and the 6 official expansions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tAutomatron</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tWasteland Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tFar Harbor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tContraptions Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tVault-Tec Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tNuka-World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, over 150 Creation Club items, featuring unique weapons, power armor sets, building packs, paint jobs, one of a kind homes, and even have Dogmeat take on the appearance of another breed, to enrich your journey through the Commonwealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate a decade of adventure, survival, and choice in a world forever changed. The wasteland is yours to explore again.</p></p><br><h1>Fallout 4: Anniversary Edition Upgrade </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/877fb12151c9c734b5ec83f03eeaf2af.avif?t=1764687456\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate a decade of Fallout 4 with the Fallout 4: Anniversary Edition Upgrade! This Upgrade includes the 6 official expansions and over 150 Creation Club items released in a single, definitive experience. You'll have hundreds of hours of irradiated fun at your disposal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes the 6 official expansions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tAutomatron</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tWasteland Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tFar Harbor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tContraptions Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tVault-Tec Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tNuka-World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, over 150 Creation Club items, featuring unique weapons, power armor sets, building packs, paint jobs, one of a kind homes, and even have Dogmeat take on the appearance of another breed, to enrich your journey through the Commonwealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallout 4 base game required.</p></p><br><h1>Review Highlights</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/3b3c93384e4a9ae4f76f4790166fcc3c.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/098dfca2ed3de7a2698317ac0c659e91.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Bethesda Game Studios, the award-winning creators of Starfield and The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim, comes Fallout 4. A landmark in open-world RPG design and winner of over 200 \u2018Best Of\u2019 honors, including the DICE and BAFTA Game of the Year. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the sole survivor of Vault 111, emerging into a world reduced to ash by nuclear war. Every moment is a battle for survival, every decision shapes the future. Rebuild, reshape, and reclaim the Wasteland\u2014your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/5f0ee5a868640265a74b503bcf08747b.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/da7e75ff538d2af951852831c81a4dd3.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/da7e75ff538d2af951852831c81a4dd3.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/da7e75ff538d2af951852831c81a4dd3.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do whatever you want in a massive open world filled with hundreds of locations, characters, and quests. Join factions, forge alliances or go it alone. The choices are yours, and every one of them matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/f61e77ce3d9724671436050fb8e69e2b.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/afa303d396ab5b07cf4b570e01c6497d.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/afa303d396ab5b07cf4b570e01c6497d.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/afa303d396ab5b07cf4b570e01c6497d.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique character with the S.P.E.C.I.A.L. system. Choose from hundreds of Perks and develop your own playstyle, whether you\u2019re a smooth-talking diplomat, stealthy sniper, or walking tank in Power Armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/96e45f901f5d8d34ec385b4d33423b6f.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/1db2fbb80734e901c3fdf6b3fe1d4d0a.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/1db2fbb80734e901c3fdf6b3fe1d4d0a.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/1db2fbb80734e901c3fdf6b3fe1d4d0a.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An all-new next generation graphics and lighting engine brings to life the world of Fallout like never before. From the blasted forests of the Commonwealth to the ruins of Boston, every location is packed with dynamic detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/47c4858932f9691b9d6cca3c7d0efc68.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/526fe07fd8291fa35d6023408543307c.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/526fe07fd8291fa35d6023408543307c.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/526fe07fd8291fa35d6023408543307c.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the dynamic Vault-Tec Assisted Targeting System (V.A.T.S.) to slow down time in combat and target enemies with cinematic precision\u2014or take the fight into your own hands with real-time gunplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/da771dcb647188df70c032e9932dfc3d.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=292 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/c4b79e9975ef388466a328d1c76d619f.poster.avif?t=1764687456\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/c4b79e9975ef388466a328d1c76d619f.webm?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/c4b79e9975ef388466a328d1c76d619f.mp4?t=1764687456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, craft, and customize like never before. Build thousands of items\u2014armor, weapons, food, and more\u2014and even construct and manage entire settlements across the Commonwealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/extras/faecf43e9696b14c9b9876eec080c515.avif?t=1764687456\" width=1560 height=194 /></span><strong> </strong></p>","developers":["Bethesda Game Studios"],"dlc":[3868650,598110,540810,404090,435881,480631,480630,490650,435880,435870],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377160/header.jpg?t=1764687456","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 ZeniMax.  ZeniMax, Bethesda Game Studios, and Fallout are trademarks of the ZeniMax group of companies.  All rights reserved.<br><br>Privacy Policy","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":84,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/fallout-4?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/377160/1672571219/644e16118aab9bd7107055611003b0383f459b6a/1762791676/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762798746","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/377160/1672571219/644e16118aab9bd7107055611003b0383f459b6a/1762791676/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762798746","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/377160/1672571219/644e16118aab9bd7107055611003b0383f459b6a/1762791676/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762798746","id":257229212,"name":"Creations Bundle Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257229212/194a6d2